<title>POLAND: Forte sees 1997 net flat at PLN 26 mln.</title>
<headline>Forte sees 1997 net flat at PLN 26 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish furniture maker Fabryki Mebli Forte SA sees its net profit flat at 26 million zlotys next year, against 25.9 million expected this year, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said it saw its sales rising to 366.3 million zlotys next year from 329.4 million zlotys forecast for this year.</p>
<p>It did not give any other details. Last year the company had a net profit of 11.7-million zlotys on 223.4-million zloty sales. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
